    <item>
      <title>叶子祯：从“星际航行”到“数智分身”——一位AI理想主义者的远见与实践</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/article-20250815161007445-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 15 Aug 2025 16:10:07 +0800</pubDate>
